{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01240","headline":"相和歌辞 陇西行 · 耿[湋]","name":"相和歌辞 陇西行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"雪下阳关路，人稀陇戍头。\n封狐犹未翦，边将岂无羞。\n白草三冬色，黄云万里愁。\n因思李都尉，毕竟不封侯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"耿[湋]","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01240.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01240","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}